&lt;p&gt;Key points:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Rate limiting&lt;/strong&gt; is abstracted in &lt;code&gt;rateLimiter.ts&lt;/code&gt;, which uses an exponential back‑off strategy per platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The script reads the per‑platform markdown (&lt;code&gt;medium_en.md&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;substack_en.md&lt;/code&gt;, etc.) and posts them via dedicated helpers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;After a successful post, the &lt;code&gt;metadata.json&lt;/code&gt; flag is flipped, making the operation idempotent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

